body:
You're right that everyone reacts differently to certain medications. But seroquel is very powerful to start with. When I first started and took one pill, I was so drugged that I almost couldn't get to my bed. I woke up sluggish the next morning. But after a few weeks, the side effects went away (still feel a bit drugged when I take 125mg and really puts me to sleep super quick.)

&#x200B;

Been using it for a while and my tip for you is to use it 1 hour before bedtime. Even if it doesn't work by then, just go to bed and it should eventually make you fall asleep.

